{"nodes":[{"id":"title","type":"text","text":"# 十元形状与轴变换总览 v0.1\n\n**狭义视觉／发型领域**\n\n已确认形状：8/10｜待补：xn、x并z\n\n[[01-十元系统/05-十元语义空间/狭义视觉库/00_十元形状感受与轴变换上游正本_v0.3.md|形状上游正本]]\n[[01-十元系统/05-十元语义空间/狭义视觉库/README_狭义视觉库总索引_v0.1.md|狭义视觉库总索引]]","x":-600,"y":-1200,"width":1200,"height":360,"color":"4"},{"id":"axis","type":"text","text":"## 轴向召回\n\n- X轴扩散、碎束横向铺开 → nx\n- 中央刘海压缩X轴 → x\n- 厚平刘海压缩Y轴 → x\n- 两侧长刘海拉长Y轴 → z\n- 局部长轴L与横轴W用于旋转发束\n\n**整体轮廓／内部纹理／局部尖束必须分层。**","x":760,"y":-1200,"width":700,"height":360,"color":"3"},{"id":"g-x","type":"group","label":"x｜三角｜刀","x":-2300,"y":-500,"width":540,"height":700,"color":"1"},{"id":"x","type":"text","text":"## x｜三角｜刀\n\n危险物品本身；锐利、切割、尖刺、直接伤害。可静止，不要求主动释放。\n\n发型：V形、尖角、锐斜切面、中心压缩。","x":-2270,"y":-430,"width":480,"height":550,"color":"1"},{"id":"g-zn","type":"group","label":"zn｜长椭圆","x":-1700,"y":-500,"width":540,"height":700,"color":"1"},{"id":"zn","type":"text","text":"## zn｜长椭圆\n\n纵向生长、自成体、两端圆润。依靠自然材质和生长状态成立。\n\n发型：自然卷团、圆润长卷、自成体纹理。","x":-1670,"y":-430,"width":480,"height":550,"color":"1"},{"id":"g-n","type":"group","label":"n｜圆形／梯形","x":-1100,"y":-500,"width":540,"height":700,"color":"6"},{"id":"n","type":"text","text":"## n｜圆形／梯形\n\n包裹、承载、下宽或圆融容积。\n\n发型：框脸、帘幕、承接脸侧与主体。","x":-1070,"y":-430,"width":480,"height":550,"color":"6"},{"id":"g-nx","type":"group","label":"nx｜方形","x":-500,"y":-500,"width":540,"height":700,"color":"4"},{"id":"nx","type":"text","text":"## nx｜方形\n\n散开、横向铺展、碎束块面化。\n\n发型：散碎、横向多束、让出中心空间。","x":-470,"y":-430,"width":480,"height":550,"color":"4"},{"id":"g-nz","type":"group","label":"nz｜扁椭圆","x":100,"y":-500,"width":540,"height":700,"color":"2"},{"id":"nz","type":"text","text":"## nz｜扁椭圆\n\n低重心、横向柔软停靠、圆钝回落。\n\n发型：蓬松横向轮廓、柔和停靠、扁圆外形。","x":130,"y":-430,"width":480,"height":550,"color":"2"},{"id":"g-z","type":"group","label":"z｜长方形","x":700,"y":-500,"width":540,"height":700,"color":"5"},{"id":"z","type":"text","text":"## z｜长方形\n\n长轴、等宽长片、长度节点。\n\n发型：两侧长刘海、垂直延伸、稳定长束。","x":730,"y":-430,"width":480,"height":550,"color":"5"},{"id":"g-zx","type":"group","label":"zx｜菱形｜挥出的刀","x":1300,"y":-500,"width":540,"height":700,"color":"4"},{"id":"zx","type":"text","text":"## zx｜菱形｜挥出的刀\n\n中部展开，力量主动推出并占据方向。\n\n发型：强斜扫、外翻、上挑、后冲。","x":1330,"y":-430,"width":480,"height":550,"color":"4"},{"id":"g-xz","type":"group","label":"xz｜长三角｜火药桶","x":1900,"y":-500,"width":540,"height":700,"color":"2"},{"id":"xz","type":"text","text":"## xz｜长三角｜火药桶\n\n危险储存在整体中，对触发点高度敏感；一旦触发可能整体爆发。\n\n发型：厚主体＋引信式尖端；长三角只是形状，不是充分条件。","x":1930,"y":-430,"width":480,"height":550,"color":"2"},{"id":"g-xn","type":"group","label":"xn｜形状待补","x":-700,"y":350,"width":620,"height":520,"color":"5"},{"id":"xn","type":"text","text":"## xn｜形状本征 pending\n\n可继续使用：规则分布、对称、等距、重复、多个节点共同运行。\n\n**禁止：** 在没有用户确认前擅自宣布某个几何形为xn正本。","x":-670,"y":420,"width":560,"height":360,"color":"5"},{"id":"g-xbz","type":"group","label":"x并z｜形状待补","x":80,"y":350,"width":620,"height":520,"color":"6"},{"id":"xbz","type":"text","text":"## x并z｜形状本征 pending\n\n可继续使用：内部结构外化为壳、幕、片、屏与界面。\n\n**禁止：** 在没有用户确认前擅自宣布某个几何形为x并z正本。","x":110,"y":420,"width":560,"height":360,"color":"6"},{"id":"danger","type":"text","text":"# 危险视觉三角\n\n```text\nx ＝ 刀\nxz＝ 火药桶\nzx＝ 挥出的刀\n```\n\n- x：危险来自锐利物品本身。\n- xz：整体蓄积并对触发高度敏感。\n- zx：力量已主动推出。\n\n**散、碎、乱、羽化不等于xz。**","x":900,"y":350,"width":920,"height":480,"color":"1"},{"id":"workflow","type":"text","text":"## 发型98种复审接口\n\n[[01-十元系统/05-十元语义空间/狭义视觉库/发型98种十元形状映射接口_v0.2.md|打开复审接口]]\n\n当前旧水库9个xz条目：02、19、23、40、44、57、61、86、97。\n\n这些旧配比、准度与排名标记为 `legacy-pending-review`，逐图复审前不得作为现行xz证据。","x":-2100,"y":350,"width":1100,"height":520,"color":"3"}],"edges":[{"id":"e-title-x","fromNode":"title","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"x","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e-title-zn","fromNode":"title","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"zn","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e-title-n","fromNode":"title","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"n","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e-title-nx","fromNode":"title","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"nx","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e-title-nz","fromNode":"title","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"nz","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e-title-z","fromNode":"title","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"z","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e-title-zx","fromNode":"title","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"zx","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e-title-xz","fromNode":"title","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"xz","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e-title-xn","fromNode":"title","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"xn","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e-title-xbz","fromNode":"title","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"xbz","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e-x-danger","fromNode":"x","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"danger","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e-xz-danger","fromNode":"xz","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"danger","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e-zx-danger","fromNode":"zx","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"danger","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e-nx-workflow","fromNode":"nx","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"workflow","toSide":"top"},{"id":"e-xz-workflow","fromNode":"xz","fromSide":"bottom","toNode":"workflow","toSide":"top"}],"metadata":{"version":"1.0-1.0","frontmatter":{"type":"ten-yuan-shape-axis-overview","status":"canonical-working","version":"0.1","canonical_path":"14-角色库/十元发型Canvas/01_十元形状与轴变换总览.canvas"}}}